<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of May 2.</p>
<p>				    May 02/Apr 30   May 02/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.12		 5.42</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.07		 4.13</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.36		 7.63</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    1.00		41.88</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    2.39		28.64</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  2.49		29.62</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.46		 6.32</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.34		13.86</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    2.51		33.85</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  2.59		33.52</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.85		11.47</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    1.36		57.83</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,090,519,629,974</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,838,456,420,805</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  2,970,807,168,956</p>
<p>  International funds			    87,631,317,841</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    193,624,722,372</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
